{"w":2400,"lines":[{"x":0.71243245895899354,"t":"Sample Writing answers","w":0.20310844421386709,"c":1,"y":0.050635287655969918,"h":0.023332188728391268},{"x":0.19031141503521487,"w":0.30276817321777344,"t":"TEST 2, WRITING TASK 1","y":0.1031976740867635,"h":0.020348837861153823,"c":1},{"y":0.14098837181078006,"w":0.58131490071614589,"h":0.017514077327399957,"c":1,"x":0.19204151148428775,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6 score."},{"h":0.017494751574527623,"y":0.17004898558162562,"x":0.19204151642100545,"w":0.70588236490885425,"t":"The maps display how the cafe changes after it was redeveloped. It compares how as it","c":1},{"x":0.18858132015189075,"y":0.19174247718922866,"t":"is now and as it is before redisign.","w":0.27854670206705734,"h":0.01610635993695908,"c":1},{"x":0.19197245876387076,"w":0.70083399454752615,"y":0.21875005348961818,"t":"First of all before the modifications, we can see that there was a kitchen and a serving","h":0.020969270742214774,"c":1},{"y":0.23970982092291027,"w":0.69568974812825513,"h":0.024237334436265745,"c":1,"t":"area at the top left hand corner of the café. Then, in the midle, there was the seatting","x":0.19022423585260279},{"h":0.018934000280872887,"t":"area, and just above, two staff dining rooms. After that, just at the bottom of the","y":0.26308139537702346,"w":0.65743942260742183,"x":0.1903114304869204,"c":1},{"x":0.19031140945817857,"y":0.28481455556869384,"h":0.017511026103484761,"w":0.69723185221354156,"c":1,"t":"entrance, there was bin and there were the toilets. However we can see that now, the"},{"w":0.71972320556640623,"y":0.30510846772122702,"x":0.19031140750721021,"c":1,"t":"bins have been changed into recycling bins. In addition, the staff dining rooms have been","h":0.019019439222096812},{"h":0.023271471241122832,"w":0.71124018351236984,"c":1,"x":0.19022587505046809,"y":0.32385435132170182,"t":"replaced with a take away food and a coffee bar. Although the seating area hasn't been"},{"y":0.34595600638715363,"w":0.69388219197591161,"t":"modificated, on the left side, a salad bar has been added. At the top left-hand corner,","c":1,"h":0.021806539398044,"x":0.19026113425177138},{"t":"the kitchen remains the same, while the serving area has been transformed into hot","y":0.36913925843722872,"w":0.68685119628906244,"h":0.018942136877979521,"x":0.19031142599183881,"c":1},{"w":0.67820068359374996,"y":0.39083275004839602,"t":"meals. Finally, a outdoor seating area and a barbecue have been constructed at the","h":0.017597482786719132,"x":0.19031142282558317,"c":1},{"x":0.1903114177606498,"h":0.015988371937820545,"c":1,"w":0.157439448038737,"t":"bottom of the café.","y":0.41133720937073825},{"x":0.19031141375689734,"h":0.016147045591980436,"w":0.27162630716959635,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","c":1,"y":0.4475157450200985},{"t":"This response addresses all of the changes illustrated in the college café plans.","x":0.23002961026760166,"h":0.02115387779753708,"c":1,"w":0.64895182291666664,"y":0.46850104576265994},{"x":0.22995468644404735,"y":0.48444398791520338,"h":0.02390958680565991,"w":0.68022827148437492,"c":1,"t":"The writer describes how the café looked before the modifications, then moves on"},{"c":1,"y":0.50726744188838768,"t":"to the present day map. There is no overview, or summary of the information, but","x":0.23010381865466173,"w":0.67301035563151035,"h":0.018974685268522196},{"x":0.22999028760494317,"w":0.31511072794596356,"h":0.020398204688678812,"y":0.52439094876465497,"c":1,"t":"all main changes have been captured."},{"t":"Intormation is generally arranged coherently. The first paragraph is an","y":0.55232558111320662,"w":0.57612457275390627,"h":0.01744186102384615,"c":1,"x":0.2283736996910278},{"w":0.61245676676432292,"x":0.22837369266124066,"h":0.019033679601777487,"c":1,"y":0.56962911106194047,"t":"introduction, and the second contains the rest of the comparison. There is"},{"x":0.23006017766537126,"t":"evidence of linking expressions [First of all | Then | After that | Although], however,","y":0.58616306641145077,"c":1,"w":0.68695927937825529,"h":0.021423448625354946},{"t":"there is a lack of reference, resulting in repetition [as it is].","h":0.022136293148310338,"c":1,"x":0.22999884003128926,"y":0.60549071105962793,"w":0.47770579020182291},{"h":0.037523327047295996,"c":1,"y":0.63331000680517102,"w":0.62871287027994793,"x":0.25247524778081809,"t":"teruors rimgin fredisign \/ redesign ( imidle \/ middle ( setting \/ serting into)"},{"t":"modificated \/ modified].","x":0.2317216168866624,"w":0.19926364898681639,"c":1,"y":0.6673267285615635,"h":0.018813982804060103},{"t":"Grammatical range is mixed. There are examples of complex sentence forms,","x":0.23004457400543837,"y":0.69447577923948756,"h":0.020671189123304456,"c":1,"w":0.63854008992513012},{"h":0.02039639744581756,"t":"but there is frequent repetition of verb forms e.g passive structures [have been","x":0.23004339133736987,"y":0.71341978195505007,"w":0.64890009562174478,"c":1},{"x":0.23010379889866953,"t":"changed | have been replaced| hasn't been modificated | has been added] which","y":0.73255813956198779,"w":0.67474049886067711,"h":0.019016387998181838,"c":1},{"w":0.46712799072265621,"h":0.019069279216235135,"c":1,"x":0.23010382241548863,"t":"means the range is limited and precludes a higher score.","y":0.74999999979484877},{"t":"To improve the score, an overview that summarises the main changes should be","y":0.77746675978305024,"c":1,"w":0.6557093302408854,"x":0.23010381230095694,"h":0.01904486809017103},{"w":0.65397923787434897,"c":1,"x":0.23010380661893029,"h":0.018991976872117844,"t":"added. It would also be beneficial to show greater accuracy in vocabulary and a","y":0.7949615114621863},{"h":0.020866448767457135,"y":0.81373897060171452,"x":0.2299592247959231,"w":0.32037249247233068,"c":1,"t":"wider range of grammatical structures."},{"h":0.018514932828653574,"t":"Example overview","c":1,"y":0.83973913525366306,"x":0.18839183546864338,"w":0.16126009623209633},{"x":0.2299908525831402,"c":1,"h":0.022120612580264098,"y":0.86456695586958576,"w":0.63865946451822919,"t":"We can see that the overall shape of the college café has remained the same,"},{"y":0.88517441863207191,"t":"with some additions, for example, outdoor areas have been added, the staff areas","c":1,"w":0.67474049886067711,"h":0.018954342441011574,"x":0.23010379895025779},{"t":"have been removed and the centralised serving area is now distributed to various","x":0.22827839773982589,"y":0.9006133347555958,"w":0.67147430419921883,"h":0.022454028867023523,"c":1},{"h":0.016153148039810494,"t":"locations in the caté.","x":0.22837370149753611,"y":0.9229651163458682,"c":1,"w":0.17474048614501952},{"y":0.95494186055294128,"c":1,"x":0.87543252646384173,"w":0.032871971130371103,"h":0.013081395100512871,"t":"129"}],"h":2857}